# Rwanda Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Rwanda's governance ecosystem.

It illustrates how governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), institutional coordination, public finance, and AI governance interact to continuously build national capability.

This document is illustrative and intended as an institutional reference architecture.

---

# National Context

Country: Republic of Rwanda

Population: ~15 million

Government System: Presidential Republic

Administrative Structure

- Central Government
- Provinces
- Districts
- Sectors
- Cells
- Villages

